tional Concussion Missile (up to a maximum of double capacity).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Concussion Missile carries a warhead containing a compact energy pack. When one explodes, it gives off a powerful concussive blast that disrupts delicate instruments and equipment, causing shock and blast damage to more durable targets. All Concussion Missiles have a 4-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Splash"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Splash"}," radius.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," missile weapons have 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," and DR 10 each; when a missile is reduced to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", its munitions explode dealing normal damage to any objects or characters within a 4-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," radius.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Armor-Piercing:"]}," Although all Concussion Missiles are designed for heavily armored targets, some are optimized for this role; however, these warheads require a more precise shot to detonate properly. Such Concussion Missiles have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Penetration"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Penetration","referenceId":"reference:07ce412924bcbe98"}," 10 (ignoring the first 10 points of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},") but cause a -5 penalty on attack rolls with the weapon.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"caption","children":["Concussion Missile Ranges\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":